<%# locals: () %>
<% tasks = { "planned" => [ [ 1, "Photograph the spring range", "Bloom Florists", "Oct 22" ], [ 2, "Book the venue", "Hartley wedding", "Oct 30" ], [ 3, "Draft the menu", "Hartley wedding", "Nov 2" ] ],
  "doing" => [ [ 4, "Write the launch email", "Bloom Florists", "Oct 20" ], [ 5, "Landing page copy", "Bloom Florists", "Oct 18" ] ],
  "review" => [ [ 6, "Logo options", "Kiln & Co", "Oct 17" ] ],
  "done" => [] } %>
<% columns = [ [ "planned", "Planned", nil ], [ "doing", "In progress", :info ], [ "review", "In review", :warning ], [ "done", "Done", :success ] ] %>
<%= ui :board, url: runeui_echo_path("board"), method: :post, label: "Tasks by status", class: "runeui-docs__full" do %>
  <% columns.each do |key, title, tone| %>
  <%# herb:key key %>
  <%= ui :board_column, id: key, title: title, tone: tone, count: tasks[key].size, empty: "Drop a task here",
    action: ui(:button, variant: :ghost, size: "icon-xs", icon: :plus, aria: { label: "Add a task to #{title}" }) do %>
    <% tasks[key].each do |id, name, client, due| %>
    <%# herb:key id %>
    <%= ui :board_card, id: id, title: name, href: "#task-#{id}", meta: client, footer: ui(:badge, variant: :outline, icon: :calendar, content: due) %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
<p>Drag a card, or focus one and use the arrows; Shift with an arrow moves it. Each move posts <code>card</code>, <code>column</code> and <code>before</code>.</p>

<h2>Folding columns, and one still loading</h2>
<% leads = [ [ 21, "Corner bakery", "Website" ], [ 22, "Hartley wedding", "Referral" ], [ 23, "Kiln & Co", "Phone" ] ] %>
<%= ui :board, id: "board-leads", url: runeui_echo_path("board", moved: "__card__"), method: :post, label: "Leads by stage", class: "runeui-docs__full" do %>
  <%= ui :board_column, id: "new", title: "New", total: 40, more: link_to("37 more", "#more-leads") do %>
    <% leads.each do |id, name, source| %>
    <%# herb:key id %>
    <%= ui :board_card, id: id, title: name, href: "#lead-#{id}", meta: source, link: { data: { lead: id } } %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
  <%= ui :board_column, id: "won", title: "Won", tone: :success, collapsible: true, collapsed: true do %>
    <%= ui :board_card, id: 24, title: "Bloom Florists", href: "#lead-24", meta: "Website" %>
  <% end %>
  <%= ui :board_column, id: "lost", title: "Lost", tone: :destructive, collapsible: true, collapsed: true, empty: "None lost" %>
<% end %>
<p>Won and Lost fold from their titles (the board's id keeps the choice in this browser). New says it has 40 though only three are here; its last item stands in for the next page. Moves post to a url naming the card (<code>?moved=__card__</code>).</p>
